{"id":"word:hebrew:H3206","type":"word","title":"יֶלֶד","subtitle":"H3206 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"something born , i.e. a lad or offspring","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יֶלֶד (H3206) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 90 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יֶלֶד (yeled) means something born , i.e. a lad or offspring First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 3 25."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יֶלֶד","transliteration":"yeled","pronunciation":"yeh'-led","strong":"H3206","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3206","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הַ/יְלָדִים֙","הַ/יָּֽלֶד","הַ/יֶּ֖לֶד","הַ/יֶּ֗לֶד","הַ/יָּ֑לֶד"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmsa",35],["HTd/Ncmpa",17],["HNcmpa",5],["HNcmpc/Sp3fp",4],["HNcmsa",3],["HC/Td/Ncmpa",3],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp3fs",3],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",3],["HNcmpc/Sp1cs",2],["HRd/Ncmsa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"something born , i.e. a lad or offspring","usage":"boy, child, fruit, son, young man (one).","full":"H3206. yeled יֶ֫לֶד 89 noun masculine Gen 21:8 child, son, boy, youth ; — יֶּ֫לֶד absolute 4:23 +; construct Jer 31:20 ; יָ֫לֶד Gen 21:16 +; plural יְלָדִים 33:1 +; construct יַלְדֵי Exod 2:6 2 t.; יִלְדֵיֿ Isa 57:4 ; suffix יְלָדַי Gen 30:26 ; 2Kin 4:1 ; יַלְדֵיהֶם Job 21:11 ; יַלְדֵיהֶן Gen 33:2 4 t., etc.; — a. child = son, boy , Gen 21:8 , 14 , 15 , 16 ; 37:30 ; 42:32 (all E), 32:23 (Dinah not included), compare 30:26 ; 33:1-2 ,(twice in verse); 33:5 (twice in verse); 33:6-7 , 13 ; 37:14 ; 44:20 (all J); Exod 1:17-18 , (|| בֵּן 1:16 ), 2:3 , 6 (twice in verse); 2:7-8 , 9 (twice in verse); 2:10 (all E), 21:4 (E; app. = sons + daughters, but || בָּנָי֫ 21:5 ); plural = offspring 21:24 (E; Hexateuch, only Genesis & Exodus, J E); also Ruth 1:5 ; 4:16 ; 2Sam 12:15 , 18 (4 t. in verse); 12:19 (twice in verse); 12:21 (twice in verse); 12:22 (twice in verse); 1Kin 3:25 (compare 3:20 ), 14:12 ; 17:21 (twice in verse); 17:22-23 , 2Kin 4:1 (compare 4:5 ) 4:18 ; 4:26 ; 4:34 ; 4:34 ; Isa 8:18 ; 9:5 (|| בֵּן ), Joel 4:3(opposed to יַלְדָּה ), Zech 8:5 ( id. ); of young of raven Job 38:41 ; of wild goats and hinds 39:3 ; of cow and bear Isa 11:7 . b. (little) child, children 1Sam 1:2 (twice in verse); 2Sam 6:23 ; Ezra 10:1 ; Neh 12:43 ; Job 21:11 (|| עֲוִילִים ), Hosea 1:2 ; Lam 4:10 ; Isa 57:5 . c. descendants Isa 29:23 , נכרים יַלְדֵי (compare בֵּן ) 2:6 . d. youth Gen 4:23 (J), 1Kin 12:8 , 10 , 14 2Chr 10:8 ; 10:10 ; 10:14 ; Dan 1:4 ; 1:10 ; 1:13 ; 1:15 ; 1:17 compare 2Kin 2:24 (|| קְטַנִּים נְעָרִים 2:23 ), Eccl 4:13 , 15 . e. figurative of apostate Israelites יִלְדֵיפֶֿשַׁע Isa 57:4 (|| שָׁ֑קֶר זֶרַע ); compare, in good sense, שַׁעֲשׁוּעִים ילד Jer 31:20 of Ephraim (|| יַקִּיר בֵּן ).","rootNote":"from 3205 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 3 25","keyReferences":["1Kgs 3 25","1Kgs 12 8","1Kgs 12 10","1Kgs 12 14","1Kgs 14 12","1Kgs 17 21","1Kgs 17 21","1Kgs 17 22"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":90,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 3 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":3,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יֶּ֥לֶד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יְלָדִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יְלָדִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 12 14","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יְלָדִים֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 14 12","book":"1Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יָּֽלֶד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 21","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/יֶּ֨לֶד֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HT